{"seq":2,"slug":"burnout-delegation","title":"倦怠、委派与继任","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/open-source-maintainership/practice/burnout-delegation","wordCount":1448,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"倦怠-委派与继任\">倦怠、委派与继任</h1><p>xz utils 后门事件里有一个常被忽略的细节：早在 2022 年 6 月，原维护者就在邮件列表里坦承自己倦怠、精力枯竭、希望有人能分担。攻击者正是嗅到了这股疲惫，扮演成一个热心、可靠、随时待命的「救星」，用一年多时间一步步骗取了维护权。换句话说，那场震动全球的供应链攻击，根子上是一起维护者倦怠事件。倦怠不只是维护者个人的痛苦，它是整个项目最大的<a href=\"../engineering/security-supply-chain\">安全</a>和<a href=\"../foundations/project-lifecycle\">可持续性</a>风险。这一篇讲如何识别倦怠、如何真正把权力委派出去、以及如何让项目在你离开后还能活——这正是把 <a href=\"../foundations/project-lifecycle\">bus factor</a> 从 1 拉高的根本工程。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>倦怠、委派、继任是同一条主线上的三个阶段：倦怠是病症，委派是疗法，继任是终极的免疫。它们之间有清晰的因果。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[单人承担全部责任&lt;br/&gt;bus factor = 1] --&gt; B[负载持续超过承载力]&#10;  B --&gt; C[倦怠 Burnout]&#10;  C --&gt; D{如何应对?}&#10;  D --&gt;|硬扛/逃避| E[失修/突然消失/被钻空子]&#10;  D --&gt;|委派| F[分散负载]&#10;  F --&gt; G[继任规划]&#10;  G --&gt; H[项目独立于个人存续]\">graph TD\n  A[单人承担全部责任&lt;br/&gt;bus factor = 1] --&gt; B[负载持续超过承载力]\n  B --&gt; C[倦怠 Burnout]\n  C --&gt; D{如何应对?}\n  D --&gt;|硬扛/逃避| E[失修/突然消失/被钻空子]\n  D --&gt;|委派| F[分散负载]\n  F --&gt; G[继任规划]\n  G --&gt; H[项目独立于个人存续]</pre><p>这张图揭示了一个反直觉的事实：对抗倦怠最有效的手段不是「少干活」或「休息」（虽然也需要），而是结构性地把责任分散出去。一个 bus factor 等于 1 的项目，维护者无论怎么自我调节，都改变不了「全世界都指望他一个人」的根本压力。</p>\n<h2 id=\"识别倦怠-信号与机理\">识别倦怠：信号与机理</h2><p>倦怠不是某天突然累垮，而是长期负载超过承载力的累积结果。2026 年的数据触目惊心：一项针对两万多名开发者的调查发现高达 73% 曾经历倦怠，约 44% 的维护者正处于倦怠状态，多个关键项目（Ingress NGINX、External Secrets Operator）直接因此退役或冻结（见 <a href=\"https://byteiota.com/open-source-maintainer-crisis-60-unpaid-burnout-hits-44/\">byteiota.com</a>）。</p>\n<p>可以用一个简化模型理解它的机理。设维护者在时间 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 的精力储备为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，承受的负载为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span>，自然恢复速率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span>，则精力变化近似为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>E</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{dE}{dt} = r \\cdot (E_{\\max} - E) - L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0574em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>当负载 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 长期大于最大恢复能力 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r \\cdot E_{\\max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 单调下降直到枯竭——这就是倦怠。这个模型告诉维护者两件事：一是恢复（休息、减压）只能把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span></span></span> 往上拉一点，治标；二是真正的解法是降低 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span>，而降低 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 的可持续方式就是委派。倦怠的早期信号包括：对议题区产生生理性抗拒、对贡献者失去耐心（措辞变冲，伤害<a href=\"../community/communication-conflict\">社区</a>）、拖延发布、幻想「要是这项目消失就好了」。维护者要学会把这些信号当成系统报警，而非个人意志力不足。</p>\n<h2 id=\"委派-从独裁到信任\">委派：从独裁到信任</h2><p>委派是说起来容易做起来极难的事。很多维护者嘴上想要帮手，行动上却紧抓所有合并权、所有决策、所有发布按钮不放——因为放手意味着接受别人会用不同于自己的方式做事，也意味着可能出错。但不委派的代价是确定的倦怠，委派的代价只是不确定的瑕疵。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>委派层次</th>\n<th>交出什么</th>\n<th>难度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>任务级</td>\n<td>让别人做具体的 PR/issue</td>\n<td>低，但只是临时帮忙</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>流程级</td>\n<td>交出<a href=\"../engineering/issue-triage\">分诊</a>、<a href=\"../community/code-review-pr\">评审</a>权</td>\n<td>中，需建立信任</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>决策级</td>\n<td>交出方向判断、发版权</td>\n<td>高，触及维护者身份</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>治理级</td>\n<td>改<a href=\"../foundations/licenses-governance\">治理模型</a>分散权力</td>\n<td>最高，从一人到制度</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>真正有效的委派是逐层向上的：先让受信任的<a href=\"../community/contributor-onboarding\">贡献者</a>分担任务，再交出流程权，最终交出决策权乃至改造治理结构。最常见的失败是停在任务级——给了头衔却不给实权，新维护者无事可做、热情冷却，原维护者继续独自硬扛。委派的核心心法是：你要培养的不是帮你干活的人，而是能替你做决定的人。</p>\n<h2 id=\"继任-让项目活过你\">继任：让项目活过你</h2><p>委派的终点是继任——确保即使你完全离开，项目也能继续。这是维护者最少被讨论、却最负责任的一项工作，它直接对应<a href=\"../foundations/project-lifecycle\">生命周期</a>里「传承 vs 衰退」的那个岔路。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[维护者意识到 bus factor = 1] --&gt; B[文档化隐性知识&lt;br/&gt;架构/决策/惯例]&#10;  B --&gt; C[在治理文件中写明继任规则]&#10;  C --&gt; D[培养并授权共同维护者]&#10;  D --&gt; E{自己要淡出?}&#10;  E --&gt;|是| F[公开移交: 仓库/账号/发布权]&#10;  E --&gt;|否| G[保持多人共同维护]&#10;  F --&gt; H[项目独立存续]&#10;  G --&gt; H\">flowchart TD\n  A[维护者意识到 bus factor = 1] --&gt; B[文档化隐性知识&lt;br/&gt;架构/决策/惯例]\n  B --&gt; C[在治理文件中写明继任规则]\n  C --&gt; D[培养并授权共同维护者]\n  D --&gt; E{自己要淡出?}\n  E --&gt;|是| F[公开移交: 仓库/账号/发布权]\n  E --&gt;|否| G[保持多人共同维护]\n  F --&gt; H[项目独立存续]\n  G --&gt; H</pre><p>继任规划包含几个具体动作：把存在维护者脑中的隐性知识（为什么当初这么设计、哪些坑不能踩）写下来，这是降低 bus factor 最直接的手段；在<a href=\"../foundations/licenses-governance\">治理文件</a>里写明「维护者如何产生、如何退出、如何移交」；以及最关键的——真正地移交，包括仓库所有权、发布凭证、域名账号这些「钥匙」。这里要特别警惕 xz 式的风险：把维护权移交给一个不够了解的新人，可能引狼入室。健康的继任建立在长期<a href=\"../community/contributor-onboarding\">社区信任</a>的基础上，而非一个疲惫维护者对任何「愿意接手的人」的病急乱投医。能让项目活过自己，是维护者成熟的最终标志，也是对下游和社区最大的负责。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>倦怠是项目最大的安全与可持续性风险，xz 后门的根子正是一起维护者倦怠事件。</li>\n<li>对抗倦怠最有效的不是休息，而是结构性地分散责任——bus factor 等于 1 时个人调节无济于事。</li>\n<li>倦怠机理可用精力方程 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>E</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{dE}{dt} = r(E_{\\max}-E) - L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2251em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8801em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 理解：治本要降低负载 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span>，即委派。</li>\n<li>委派要逐层向上（任务→流程→决策→治理），核心是培养能替你做决定的人，而非只帮你干活的人。</li>\n<li>继任靠文档化隐性知识、写明治理移交规则、真正移交钥匙；移交对象须建立在长期社区信任上，以防 xz 式引狼入室。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"倦怠、委派与继任","id":"倦怠-委派与继任"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"识别倦怠：信号与机理","id":"识别倦怠-信号与机理"},{"level":2,"text":"委派：从独裁到信任","id":"委派-从独裁到信任"},{"level":2,"text":"继任：让项目活过你","id":"继任-让项目活过你"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"资金与可持续性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/open-source-maintainership/practice/funding-sustainability"},"next":{"title":"常见反模式与权衡","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/open-source-maintainership/practice/maintainer-antipatterns"}}